  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> Varies</p>\n<p><strong>Mods:</strong> All Melee Weapons</p>\n<p><em>Flammable coatings, nano-barbs, and sharpened edges can allow melee implements to perform incredible feats of violence.</em></p>\n<p>Enhances the weapon with one of the following abilities, the cost of which is determined by the Bladesmith mod chosen:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Barbed:</strong> 100eb (Premium) — All Attacks from the weapon also have the effect of Burrowing Ammunition (IRV5, pg. 120).</li>\n<li><strong>Guided:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) — All Attacks from the weapon also have the effect of Smart Ammunition (CP:R, pg. 346).</li>\n<li><strong>Serrated:</strong> 250eb (Expensive) — All Attacks from the weapon also have the effect of Hollow Point Ammunition (IRV5, pg. 121).</li>\n<li><strong>Sharpened:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) — The first time the weapon ablates armor in a Round, it ablates 1 additional SP.</li>\n<li><strong>Volatile:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) — All Attacks from the weapon also have the effect of Incendiary Ammunition (CP:R, pg. 346).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0 (Weapon Mod)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Mod Catalog &gt; Weapon Mods).</em></p>"
